This procurement concerns the aggregation, acquisition and provision of Commercial Resources to be incorporated into the GOVSATCOM Common Union Pool for the purpose of the GOVSATCOM Hub Governmental Service provision, as described in the Tender Specifications and in Annex II - Descriptive Document. 
In particular, this call for tenders aims at establishing one Framework Contract between the Contracting Authority and one or more economic operators for:
•	The aggregation of existing or future Commercial Resources provided by the Resource(s) Providers, in the most varied and complete catalogue, at the Framework Contract level;
•	The purchase of Commercial Resources by the Contractor from the different Resources Providers included in the catalogue, in its own name;
•	The provision of Commercial Resources by the Contractor to the GOVSATCOM Hub Operator, in view of the GOVSATCOM Hub Governmental Services supply by the Contracting Authority through the GOVSATCOM Hub.
Governmental resources already offered in the GOVSACTCOM Common Union Pool as a result of the dedicated call for tenders concluded by means of contracts with the governmental resource providers signed in 2025 cannot be subject to the present procurement and the ensuing contracts.

This procurement concerns the aggregation, acquisition and provision of Commercial Resources to be incorporated into the GOVSATCOM Common Union Pool for the purpose of the GOVSATCOM Hub Governmental Service provision, as described in the Tender Specifications and in Annex II - Descriptive Document. 
In particular, this call for tenders aims at establishing one Framework Contract between the Contracting Authority and one or more economic operators for:
•	The aggregation of existing or future Commercial Resources provided by the Resource(s) Providers, in the most varied and complete catalogue, at the Framework Contract level;
•	The purchase of Commercial Resources by the Contractor from the different Resources Providers included in the catalogue, in its own name;
•	The provision of Commercial Resources by the Contractor to the GOVSATCOM Hub Operator, in view of the GOVSATCOM Hub Governmental Services supply by the Contracting Authority through the GOVSATCOM Hub.
Governmental resources already offered in the GOVSACTCOM Common Union Pool as a result of the dedicated call for tenders concluded by means of contracts with the governmental resource providers signed in 2025 cannot be subject to the present procurement and the ensuing contracts.
